    <!-- Carlos 2026-11-20: "Send daily in the morning on the Aplayers and leaders
         text chain" / "Leaders you can send at 9am". Mon-Sat 9:00 (9:20 = retry):
         pull AppStream's per-person 2nd-round lists (best effort), build the
         BY LEADER 2nd rounds and new starts picture for the last 4 Mon-Sun weeks
         through yesterday, text it to NEW A Players and ATT B2B Leaders. Each
         chain texts once a day (second_round_text_state.json), so the retry and
         a hand send never double up. Install: install_second_round_leaders_daily_agent. -->
